@page "/ApiReference"

@layout SnapCd.Server.Core.UI.Dashboard.Layout.AccountInteractiveLayout

<PageTitle>API Reference - Snap CD</PageTitle>

@* Scalar assumes it owns its document (window scrolling, document-coordinate
   popovers, body theme classes), so it runs on its own page — served by
   ApiReferenceEndpoints — and is framed here. The framed page is ours: it loads
   snapcd-theme.css and the theme cookie stamp, so branding is identical. *@
@* Flush to the top, right, and bottom: negative margins cancel the layout's pa-4
   on those three sides (this layout has no app bar); only the left buffer next
   to the nav drawer remains. *@
<iframe src="ApiReference/Standalone"
        style="display:block;width:calc(100% + 16px);height:100vh;margin:-16px -16px -16px 0;border:none;"/>
